* text=auto eol=lf

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

# The upstream OFL licence text is kept BYTE-IDENTICAL to what IBM ships, CRLF included.
# `* text=auto eol=lf` above would otherwise rewrite its line endings, and a licence file is the
# one thing in this repository that should not be normalised on our way past it.
public/fonts/store-syria/OFL.txt -text

# P2.5-DESIGN-B. The brand artwork, for the same reason the licence above carries `-text`:
# `* text=auto eol=lf` decides binary-ness by heuristic, and these are the product's identity --
# a single misdetected file is a corrupted logo on every screen. VERIFIED before pinning it, so
# this is belt-and-braces rather than a repair: every file's byte size in the index already
# matched its size on disk, so `text=auto` had classified all six correctly.
public/assets/images/brand/** -text

/.github export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore
.styleci.yml export-ignore
